{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36465","headline":"春过白遥岭 · 罗邺","name":"春过白遥岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟道穿云望峡遥，羸蹄经宿在迢嶤。\n到来山下春将半，上得林端雪未消。\n返驾王尊何足叹，哭途阮籍谩无聊。\n未知遇此恓惶者，泣向东风鬓欲凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}